        "scope": "in_scope",
        "statement": "Let $A,B\\in\\CC^{p\\times n}$, where $p,n\\geq1$, and put\n\\[\n H=A^*B+B^*A,\\qquad R=A^*A+B^*B.\n\\]\nFor every $S\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$,\n\\begin{equation}\n |\\det H[S,S]|\\leq\\det R[S,S].\n\\end{equation}\nConsequently, for $0\\leq k\\leq n$,\n\\begin{equation}\n \\bigl|\\ee_k(\\lambda(H))\\bigr|\n \\leq\\sum_{|S|=k}|\\det H[S,S]|\n \\leq\\ee_k(\\lambda(R)).\n\\end{equation}",
